      "sourceTextSha256": "15fd68fc701ca054ad924adcbc4167606dc6140306a5d1ef612bf1f125de2267",
      "text": "Day 12 · After breakfast, explore the Brazilian side of the falls, along the canyon of the Iguaçu River. Within a national park of unique flora and fauna, some 275 waterfalls converge towards the spectacular Devil’s Throat; along the rainforest paths, viewpoints reveal cascades, mist and rainbows from ever-changing perspectives. Optional: the Macuco Safari or the Bird Park.",
