      "sourceTextSha256": "186dae711076ff2b87208064d94ee0c56cb1800594bdfe94c3969aa1f8b07d79",
      "text": "Day 13 · Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport and flight to Rio de Janeiro. On arrival, transfer to your hotel with a local guide.\n\nGreen hills, blue skies, rocky mountains, beautiful bays, islands and beaches: Brazil’s second most populous city is one of the most beautiful in the world. By day or night, stroll along the famous black-and-white tiled promenades of Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon.",
